"in_review states count; approved, rejected, withdrawn and archived do not."
msgstr ""
"Demandes d'approbation ouvertes sur les factures clients/fournisseurs pour "
"ce partenaire. Les états pending et in_review comptent ; approved, rejected,"
" withdrawn et archived ne comptent pas."

#. module: eh_account_approval
